; claude: the system applications -- none yet, a placeholder for the
; category (CATALOG.md gets its section with the first one). Laid out
; like office/: the programs here, software/ for the golden frames,
; web/ for the browser.
;
; What it might contain, each Tiny and after a famous original:
;  - a desktop (the Xerox Star 1981, the Macintosh Finder 1984): icons,
;    windows, the trash, over the documents the office apps save;
;  - a file manager (Norton Commander, 1986): two panes of files;
;  - a terminal and a shell (VT100, the Bourne shell): lines in, lines
;    out, a few commands;
;  - the desk accessories (the Mac's Calculator, Alarm Clock, Note Pad,
;    Puzzle): each a page long.
; Built on gui/ and the store (plan_io.md); see also the planned ix
; series, whose emulator would run on the Playground.
